        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Large Door Pull with Domed Ends</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModel #11Dx large contemporary door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, appliance doors. Just about anywhere a large door pull is needed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery clean contemporary design, large 1-1/2\" diameter pull handle is easy to grab and makes a bold statement. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Pair of <a href=\"/products/large-door-pull-with-domed-ends-pair-first-impressions-11db\"><b>Model #11DB Back to Back Mounted</b></a> door pulls for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Model #11Dx Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Standard Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-11DA:  Total Length 21-1/2\", Center to Center Mount 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-11DB: Total Length 25-1/2\", Center to Center Mount 16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impression door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 10 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
