                "description": "First Impressions 11DB door pull. Very clean contemporary design, large 1-1/2 inch diameter pull handle is easy to grab and makes a bold statement.  Model #11Dx large contemporary door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, appliance doors. Just about anywhere a large door pull is needed",
